{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/train-INC-58-r1/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "INC-58  Manifest TEU totals are short for 45-foot boxes\nstatus: open   priority: P2   area: cargo   reported: 2026-07-02 by yard-planning\n\nThe vessel manifests we send to the line come out short on TEU whenever there are\n45-foot high-cube boxes on board. The yard counts a 45 as two and a quarter TEU, like\neveryone else in the industry, but our totals treat it as a plain 40.\n\nAcceptance:\n  teuOf counts a 45-foot container as two and a quarter TEU (20-foot and 40-foot boxes are\n  unchanged), so a manifest of one 20-foot, one 40-foot and one 45-foot box totals five\n  and a quarter TEU.\n\nFiles:\n  src/cargo/manifest.ts", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_01Cr7LyDw7UkMvXZKjk8guLr", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "sessionId": "7acd43bf-f0c3-40ce-bbc7-92a4b31c15b8", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:33:23.240Z", "toolUseResult": {"stdout": "INC-58  Manifest TEU totals are short for 45-foot boxes\nstatus: open   priority: P2   area: cargo   reported: 2026-07-02 by yard-planning\n\nThe vessel manifests we send to the line come out short on TEU whenever there are\n45-foot high-cube boxes on board. The yard counts a 45 as two and a quarter TEU, like\neveryone else in the industry, but our totals treat it as a plain 40.\n\nAcceptance:\n  teuOf counts a 45-foot container as two and a quarter TEU (20-foot and 40-foot boxes are\n  unchanged), so a manifest of one 20-foot, one 40-foot and one 45-foot box totals five\n  and a quarter TEU.\n\nFiles:\n  src/cargo/manifest.ts"}, "type": "user"}
