{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/train-INC-58-r1/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"text": "## Summary\n\nI've successfully resolved **INC-58**. The issue was that 45-foot high-cube containers were incorrectly calculated as 2 TEU instead of 2.25 TEU in the cargo manifest system.\n\n**What was fixed:**\n- Modified `src/cargo/manifest.ts:10` to return 2.25 for 45-foot containers instead of 2\n- This ensures manifest totals are accurate: a manifest with one 20-ft (1 TEU) + one 40-ft (2 TEU) + one 45-ft (2.25 TEU) now correctly totals 5.25 TEU\n- All tests pass with this change\n\n**Commit:** `a390cc2` - \"Fix 45-foot container TEU calculation\"", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CfV8mv4tmZN32SPkLnn2z", "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "role": "assistant"}, "sessionId": "7acd43bf-f0c3-40ce-bbc7-92a4b31c15b8", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:34:03.338Z", "type": "assistant"}
